cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the skipMCA package, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "Coding questionnaire skips in composite health indices: code"
abstract: >-
  Code, summary results and the skipMCA R package for the paper "Coding
  questionnaire skips in composite health indices: a plasmode simulation
  study". The paper derives how much of a questionnaire filter each coding of a
  skipped item carries into an index built by multiple correspondence analysis
  and tests the theory in a plasmode simulation resampling covariates from four
  Demographic and Health Surveys. No survey microdata are included.
type: software
